# EcomScaling production workers. The VPS clock is UTC.
#
# Fuente de verdad versionada de `crontab -l` del usuario `deploy` en el VPS.
# Instalar con:  scp ops/vps/*.sh ops/vps/*.crontab ecom:/opt/ecomscaling/
#                ssh ecom 'crontab /opt/ecomscaling/ecomscaling.crontab'
#
# Todo job debe estar ademas en la lista blanca de run-worker-job.sh, o sale
# con codigo 64 sin ejecutar nada. Cada job toma su propio flock, asi que una
# pasada lenta nunca se solapa consigo misma; los minutos de abajo estan
# elegidos para que dos jobs distintos no coincidan (el VPS tiene 1.6 GB y
# cada job levanta su propio contenedor).

SHELL=/bin/bash
PATH=/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin
MAILTO=""

# --- Integraciones y mantenimiento ---------------------------------------
# meta-reconcile va a las 0:17 (antes 3:17) para que la cadena nocturna lea el
# gasto de ayer y no el de anteayer. Shopify se reconcilia a las 0:00 UTC dentro
# del worker (2:00 Madrid) y klaviyo a las 0:43.
17 0 * * * /opt/ecomscaling/run-worker-job.sh meta-reconcile
43 */6 * * * /opt/ecomscaling/run-worker-job.sh klaviyo-reconcile
7 3 * * * /opt/ecomscaling/run-worker-job.sh purge-expired-deletions

# --- Cadena nocturna F3 -> F7 (diagnostico, decision, playbooks, 6.00-6.04,
# 7.01-7.14), en orden y en serie dentro de un solo job. Tiene hasta las 3:35,
# cuando empiezan los benchmarks que leen lo que deja.
0 1 * * * /opt/ecomscaling/run-worker-job.sh nightly-chain

# --- Benchmarks por dimension + lectura transversal ----------------------
35 3 * * * /opt/ecomscaling/run-worker-job.sh conversion-cro-benchmarks
45 3 * * * /opt/ecomscaling/run-worker-job.sh offer-pricing-benchmarks
55 3 * * * /opt/ecomscaling/run-worker-job.sh retention-crm-benchmarks
15 4 * * * /opt/ecomscaling/run-worker-job.sh unit-economics-benchmarks
25 4 * * * /opt/ecomscaling/run-worker-job.sh operations-cx-benchmarks
35 4 * * * /opt/ecomscaling/run-worker-job.sh product-inventory-benchmarks
50 4 * * * /opt/ecomscaling/run-worker-job.sh scalability-benchmarks
5 5 * * * /opt/ecomscaling/run-worker-job.sh anomalies-red-flags
20 5 * * * /opt/ecomscaling/run-worker-job.sh benchmark-confidence

# --- F7 recomendacion / F8 ejecucion (diarios, en orden de fase) ---------
# Migrados desde GitHub Actions el 2026-09-24 (workflows borrados en 2b2ab70).
# Van detras de benchmark-confidence (5:20) porque leen lo que este deja.
35 5 * * * /opt/ecomscaling/run-worker-job.sh expected-outcome
50 5 * * * /opt/ecomscaling/run-worker-job.sh recommendation-confidence
5 6 * * * /opt/ecomscaling/run-worker-job.sh recommendation-communication
20 6 * * * /opt/ecomscaling/run-worker-job.sh execution-plan
35 6 * * * /opt/ecomscaling/run-worker-job.sh readiness
50 6 * * * /opt/ecomscaling/run-worker-job.sh hitl-approval
5 7 * * * /opt/ecomscaling/run-worker-job.sh closure-handoff

# --- F8/F9 continuos (cada hora, como en Actions) ------------------------
12 * * * * /opt/ecomscaling/run-worker-job.sh action-envelope
27 * * * * /opt/ecomscaling/run-worker-job.sh execution-supervision
57 * * * * /opt/ecomscaling/run-worker-job.sh continuous-learning
